00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.510 align:start position:0%
 
what's up everybody my name is clinton  jones and i am the punisher  today i am excited to announce  the next community render challenge  last year i challenge you all to create  your very best render  from a simple bare bones animation that  i provided to you guys  nvidia and pny sent me an nvidia rtx  quadro 6000 to show off its insane  performance  and over the following month i live  streamed the creation of my most  ambitious  render to date 125 artists submitted  their renders and five of you guys  won some top tier prizes thanks to  nvidia and pny  now enough people have asked for another  render challenge and guys today i'm here  to deliver and happy to announce the  alternate realities community render  challenge  where i'm challenging you guys to use  the animation provided  to create the coolest render you can  possibly create  and over the next month i'm going to be  live streaming the process  of my 3d animation and at the end  combining everything together to make  the most epic 3d montage the world has  ever seen  and if you're on the fence let me just  start with the prizes i reached out to  some of my favorite companies  to build a prize pool full of products  that i not only love but use every  single day to create the art that i love  creating we're talking rococo wacom  pny aftershocks and quixl  so without further ado i give you guys  the community  challenge prize pool starting with  fourth and fifth place  you actually get two things first is a  one year subscription to the qixel mega  scans  library it's my absolute favorite  one-stop shop  for the largest collection of high  quality 3d scans  materials and even metahumans i use mega  scans for every single project  and i hope to get you guys hooked too  and on behalf of pny  fourth and fifth place also get a pny  two terabyte two and a half  inch sata solid state drive for quick  read and write speeds  of all your files and programs now i  know a lot of you guys aren't from the  united states we have a big  international audience and keeping the  prizes  open to my international audience is a  big deal for me  so if any of these companies can't ship  to your area for whatever reason  they'll ship them to me and i'll ship  them to you myself  now if your render comes in third place  you're gonna get a wacom  intuos pro tablet and wacom is so cool  that they're gonna let you choose either  a small medium or large size  tablet i personally use the medium but  you guys might like the large size you  might like the small  i love these tablets because they save  your wrist  which you're gonna jack up if you use a  mouse too often also there's a ton of  different buttons and hotkeys on this  thing so you guys can work super  efficiently i literally hadn't owned a  mouse  since i got one of these things and i'm  never going back we all we're not even  halfway through  with the third place prizes because pny  is swooping in  again to get you all a one terabyte m2  pcie  gen 4 ssd the read and write speeds on  this thing  are ludicrous and finally third place  also gets the year-long subscription to  the quixote mega scans library  that's right guys these prizes yeah they  stack  now if your render comes in second place  out of who knows how many submissions i  will receive  you're lucky to not only get the wacom  intuos pro tablet  the pny one terabyte m2 pcie  gen 4 ssd the one year long quixote mega  scan subscription but  also a pair of my favorite  aeropex open ear headphones by  aftershocks i freaking love these things  i use them to listen to music and  podcasts  all the time when i'm going on walks  when i'm working when i'm  filming basically anytime anywhere and  the kicker is that you can still hear  your surroundings with these things they  don't go in your ear they kind of go by  your temple and they vibrate the bones  in your head  and music is a big inspiration for me  when it comes to my renders so i'm  hoping that these can help you guys out  as much  as they've helped me and if your render  is the best render  out of all the renders then you will  receive  the qixel mega scans one year  subscription the wacom intuos pro tablet  the pny one terabyte m2 pcie ssd  the aeropex open ear headphones by  aftershocks  and the grand prize a full performance  capture  bundle from rococo complete with the  smartsuit pro  smart gloves and a year-long  subscription to their studio plus  software  including the facial capture with  rococo's full performance capture bundle  you guys will be able to capture your  body data  your hand and finger data and your  facial data  to tell more unique stories you'll never  have to hand animate this stuff ever  again  and i actually use rococo's smartsuit  pro to record the animation data for  this  challenge their software allows you to  loop the animation data too which is  perfect for this content  because i want each submission to  seamlessly flow into the next when  combined together for the internet's  largest render montage  so what makes a winning render in my  mind well  probably uh render quality attention to  detail  overall composition use of color and  lighting  and probably uniqueness judging this  contest is not going to be easy because  there's going to be a ton of submissions  so to keep things fair and unbiased i'm  going to recruit two guest judges  for this challenge that i will announce  a little bit closer to the submission  date of june  1st june 1st is the deadline to submit  your render  so as a resource for you guys over the  course of this month during the render  challenge  myself and the discord mods have set up  a series of channels on my discord  server  to answer frequently asked questions a  place where you can show your renders  in a place where you can get advice on  your works in progress so if you're  looking to push yourself and create an  incredible piece of art  over the next month then click the link  in the description  to get started inside our project files  for  every modern 3d program in a video  called watch me first  it goes over the details of how to set  up your render and how to deliver  your submission again by june 1st if you  guys don't know how to get started then  start with this video here where i  create concept art  based off an idea i see in my head to  kind of give me a look and feel  in a direction for the render that i  want to create  but guys i can't wait to see what we  make together let's get to it  download the link in the description  june 1st is the deadline  and i'll see you guys next week in the  live stream where i'll be working on my  piece of art  alongside you guys see you soon peace  [Music]  you

